    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">I&#39;ve been configuring RApache in my<span> </span><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">rapache.conf</font><span> </span>file like so:</div><div style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><br></div><div style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">LoadModule R_module /etc/httpd/modules/mod_R.so</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\"><br></font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">&lt;Location /RApacheInfo&gt;</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">  SetHandler r-info</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">&lt;/Location&gt;</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\"><br></font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">&lt;Directory /var/www/html/rscripts&gt;</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">  SetHandler r-script</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">  RHandler sys.source</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">&lt;/Directory&gt;</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\"><br></font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">&lt;Directory /var/www/html/brew&gt;</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">  SetHandler r-script</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">  RHandler brew::brew</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">&lt;/Directory&gt;</font></div></div><div style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><br></div><div style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">I placed a<span> </span><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">hello-world.R</font><span> </span>file with the following code inside the<span> </span><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">/var/www/html/rscripts</font><span> </span>directory:</div><div style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><br></div><div style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">setContentType(&quot;text/html&quot;)</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">cat(&quot;&lt;HTML&gt;&lt;BODY&gt;&lt;H1&gt;&quot;)</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">cat(&quot;Hello from R!&quot;)</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">cat(&quot;&lt;/H1&gt;&lt;/BODY&gt;&lt;/HTML&gt;&quot;)</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">DONE</font></div></div><div style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><br></div><div style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">However, when I navigate to<span> </span><font face=\"courier new, monospace\"><a href=\"http://mywebsite.com/rscripts/\" style=\"color:rgb(17,85,204)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://mywebsite.com/rscripts/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793239428371000&amp;usg=AOvVaw10n4NVNgmbuYi8RcpxKYLe\">mywebsite.com/rscripts/</a><span> </span></font><font face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">I get a download dialog from my browser like this one:<br><br></font></div><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><a style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" href=\"https://lh5.googleusercontent.com/-iemLhlXbxK8/U76CgStRcZI/AAAAAAAAACU/ezz3UM75nXg/s1600/Screen+shot+2014-07-09+at+7.17.07+PM.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh5.googleusercontent.com/-iemLhlXbxK8/U76CgStRcZI/AAAAAAAAACU/ezz3UM75nXg/s1600/Screen%2Bshot%2B2014-07-09%2Bat%2B7.17.07%2BPM.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793239428371000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2tffueICyPKSIUiHxbOFgw\"><img src=\"https://lh5.googleusercontent.com/-iemLhlXbxK8/U76CgStRcZI/AAAAAAAAACU/ezz3UM75nXg/s320/Screen+shot+2014-07-09+at+7.17.07+PM.png\" border=\"0\" height=\"242\" width=\"320\"></a></p><div style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><font face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><br></font></div><div style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><font face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">I thought RApache was supposed to execute<span> </span></font><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">.R</font><font face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span> </span>files with the proper<span> </span></font><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">.conf</font><font face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span> </span>setup? Google searching hasn&#39;t turned up any leads. Any ideas?</font></div><div style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><font face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><br></font></div><div style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><font face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Any help is much appreciated.</font></div></div>"
